"""Testing Spring Boot explainer: scene layouts and per-beat narration + motion.

Outputs from a Spring Boot 3.5 project (JUnit 5, Mockito, Testcontainers 1.21) on JDK 21 with real PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7 and Kafka 3.9.1, study note 03.12:
per-class run times: unit 4 tests ~1 s, @WebMvcTest 4 tests ~0.8 s, @DataJpaTest + H2 ~2.1 s, + PostgreSQL container ~19 s,
@SpringBootTest + Redis container ~23 s, + Kafka container ~72 s (20 s deliberate wait); mock vs spy on ArrayList: add("a") then size() 0 vs 1,
when(spy.get(5)) -> IndexOutOfBoundsException; @WebMvcTest without SecurityConfig: no user 401, valid user but service throws NotFound 404 problem+json,
POST without CSRF 403, with csrf and bad body 400, valid body 201 Location /api/orders/100; @DataJpaTest uses H2 (jdbc:h2:mem:...), rolls back (next test sees 0 rows);
native query "on conflict (sku) do nothing": H2 InvalidDataAccessResourceUsageException, PostgreSQL 16.14 returns 1 then 0.
Theme: mono.
"""
